    "description": "Nestled in the flats of Noe Valley, with a 97 WalkScore and just steps to a designated \"Slow Street'', sits this gorgeous Edwardian, fully-vacant duplex boasting period details and timeless charm throughout. Each one bedroom, one bathroom flat features newly refinished hardwood floors, crown moldings and light-filled open layouts, with the upper flat containing an office/flex 2nd bedroom. The upper flat offers a bright open living room with dual-sided fireplace, A/C in-unit, attached deck, and spacious eat-in kitchen with skylight. Each home is unique, with the lower flat offering a large living room, an updated eat-in kitchen, central heat/AC and a split, modern bathroom. Steps outside your door, a large, sunny deck perfect for lounging, BBQ or entertaining! This property also provides two independent garages, plus additional ample storage & laundry room. A rare opportunity to live in one of San Francisco's most beloved neighborhoodsideal as a primary residence with income, an investment multi-family property, or for multi-generational living. Enjoy the vibrant lifestyle of Noe Valley in this prime location with a 97 WalkScore, just a block to 24th and Church St. shops, restaurants, Whole Foods, the J-Church Rail while only mins to Dolores Park & Valencia Corridor."
  },
